y can find something  suspicious and use it against the hotel  in their ongoing case however soo yan  suddenly gets an upset stomach and  rushes to the hotel restroom since she  doesn't feel too well soo yeon stays  behind in the toilet and asks young woo  to go in her place as a result young woo  reunites with jun ho and tells him that  they will have to call each other  sweetie now meaning the two will have to  act as a couple they hurry for their  meeting with the director of the wedding  business later they sit on a hotel sofa  and pretend to book a wedding date after  a while they also look at the available  dresses and pick out a dress similar to  the one hua young wore for her wedding  the director isn't satisfied with young  woo's choice of dress but the latter is  adamant about trying that fit in the  meantime soo yan who is still suffering  from her stomach ailment overhears ji  hai a hotel employee talking in the  restroom about how another employee was  fired following the dress mishap she  immediately calls junhoe and informs her  about the finding junhoe then follows ji  hai into the staff room and inquires  about the fired employee's contact  information but she isn't willing to  give away the information so quickly  after a while junhoe returns to the room  where jung-woo is clad in a white gown  with a bouquet in her hands junhoe is at  a loss for words after seeing her  however they don't find anything  suspicious with the dress the only sus  thing is that she must be on the run  from heaven because she looks like an  angel  that sucked in the next scene attorney  jung and his team sit with the judge and  to die hyeon hotel's legal team it's  clear that the hotel's team isn't  backing down since it can damage their  reputation while young woo and jun ho  spend some alone time together at a  bakery they spot ji hai and again plead  for the fired employee's contact  information this time jihai finally  opens up about the incident and informs  them th